  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Stay quick on your feet and unstoppable in your mindset with the ASICS GEL-NYC 2055. Inspired by the designs of archived running shoes from the early ‚Äò00s, these silhouettes offer a stunning look that you don‚Äôt want to miss. Inspired by the GT-2050 and GT-2060 running sneakers, the upper features eye-catching ASICS Stripes, a heel counter, and an eyelet structure, delivering a nostalgic style and comfortable feel during your daily runs. The tooling contrasting the retro-style upper is influenced by the GEL-CUMULUS 16 shoe‚Äôs tooling system. The plush midsole uses a combination of lightweight foams and GEL technology inserts to provide superior underfoot comfort. Dash with determination and finish with pride in the ASICS GEL-NYC 2055.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-NYC 2055 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh upper offers a breathable feel.</li> <li>EVA midsole provides all-day comfort.</li> <li>Rearfoot and forefoot GEL technology reduces impact during heel strike, enables smooth transition, and enhances shock reduction.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers optimum traction, grip, and durability. </li> </ul><hr /><p>Retro running DNA meets all-day comfort in a pair built to keep your everyday rotation feeling light, cushioned, and easy to style. The ASICS¬Æ GEL-NYC 2055 updates early-2000s performance inspiration with design cues from the GT-2050 and GT-2060, then pairs that throwback upper with GEL-CUMULUS 16-inspired tooling for a smooth, supportive ride from morning errands to weekend plans.</p><ul><li>Breathable mesh upper with layered synthetic details for a classic runner look</li><li>EVA midsole adds lightweight comfort for daily wear</li><li>Rearfoot and forefoot GEL technology help soften impact and keep every step feeling cushioned</li><li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Available reviews point to a true-to-size fit, so for the best fit, we recommend ordering your usual size. Reviewers also highlight a comfortable, well-cushioned feel right out of the box.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>A strong pick for everyday wear, long days on your feet, and casual outfits with a sporty edge.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>The layered runner design brings together breathable mesh, bold ASICS striping, and a sculpted sole for an easy mix of heritage sport style and modern wearability. It pairs effortlessly with leggings, denim, cargos, and other laid-back staples while delivering comfort that lasts through the day.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-NYC 2055 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Cream/Carbon</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A542-101</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  